  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 30-layer HfO2/SiO2 chirped multilayer coating on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2(1)/SiO2(2)/HfO2(3)/SiO2(4)/HfO2(5)/SiO2(6)/HfO2(7)/SiO2(8)/HfO2(9)/SiO2(10)/HfO2(11)/SiO2(12)/HfO2(13)/SiO2(14)/HfO2(15)/SiO2(16)/HfO2(17)/SiO2(18)/HfO2(19)/SiO2(20)/HfO2(21)/SiO2(22)/HfO2(23)/SiO2(24)/HfO2(25)/SiO2(26)/HfO2(27)/SiO2(28)/HfO2(29)/SiO2(30). Implement monotonicity-enforcing parameterization: define each layer thickness t_i = t_base + cumulative_sum(exp(ξ_j)) for j=0 to i, where ξ_j are the optimizable parameters and t_base is a fixed offset. Evaluate at normal incidence, unpolarized illumination. Optimize for maximum transmittance in 1000-1700 nm band and maximum reflectance in 300-450 nm band. Constrain outermost SiO2 layer (layer 30) thickness >= 200 nm for environmental durability. Use gradient-based optimizer with the monotonicity mapping to reduce effective degrees of freedom. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 300-450 nm, 1000-1700 nm. soft objectives: high transmission in 1000-1700 nm; high reflection in 300-450 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: low transmission in 300-450 nm; low reflection in 1000-1700 nm. manufacturing constraints: total layer count <= 30; materials restricted to HfO2 and SiO2.",
  "normalized_request_english": "Optimize a thirty-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 chirped coating on fused silica with air incidence across 300-1700 nm. Maximize average transmittance in 1000-1700 nm and average reflectance in 300-450 nm at normal incidence. Constrain the thirtieth SiO2 layer thickness to be at least 200 nm.",
